# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints

# Node / web build. The web stage runs `npm ci` from the lockfile, so a host
# node_modules would only bloat the context (240MB+, and it can hold
# platform-specific binaries). A local dashboard build is rebuilt in the web
# stage, and copying it in would leave orphaned hashed assets that index.html no
# longer references.
#
# The `**/` prefixes are required, not decorative: Docker matches these patterns
# against the whole context-relative path with Go filepath.Match semantics, where
# `*` does not cross `/`. A bare `node_modules/` matches only a directory at the
# context root, so it would not exclude web/node_modules.
**/node_modules
src/gateway/static/dashboard/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# mypy
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json

